# Bolt; Bot2, holding a Bolt too, is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Grief
Dark Ritual
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Bot3 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
